# Jackpot and Superjackpot for iomoon, at the country default (4, Netherlands, English
# text, F11).  The two awards no other capture in this corpus attempts: the multiball
# capture reaches Multiball and then presses only lanes 1 and 2, so LD2 and LR21 are lit
# through the whole mode and neither is ever collected.
#
# What the firmware needs (docs/iomoon_game_rules.md 3.2.1, 3.3.2, 3.3.5):
#   1. Multiball running.  ORBITS complete (six lane-4 / bull's-eye-1 pairs put
#      [413C:0102] at its cap of 6), then two Jupiter locks with the drop bank left
#      STANDING -- a flattened bank would give Wonderful Thing instead (3.3.7).
#   2. LD2 lit at bull's-eye 2 and LR21 lit at Ramp 2.  Both light when Multiball starts
#      and go out when it ends, which is what makes these Multiball-only awards.
#   3. Then hit them: bull's-eye 2 (RCtrl+B, C38 code 0x2E) pays the JPOT value, and
#      Ramp 2 (RCtrl+R, C39/C47) pays double it.
#
# Credits come from six coins in this run rather than a pre-seeded store: one coin does
# not buy a credit under country 4's own preset, and a coin pressed during the first
# attract cycle is lost.  Nothing outside this file is needed.
#
# Keys: 5 coin, 1 start, Space plunge, S lane 4, LCtrl+B bull's-eye 1,
#       RCtrl+B bull's-eye 2, J Jupiter, RCtrl+R ramp 2, Y lane 1.
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  6641 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6721 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6801 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6881 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6961 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7041 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7200 mark credit
  7210 tap 10 KEYCODE_1
  7400 mark ball-1-start
  7410 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  7700 mark orbits-lane4-1
  7710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7790 mark orbits-letter-1
  7800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  7900 mark orbits-lane4-2
  7910 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7990 mark orbits-letter-2
  8000 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8100 mark orbits-lane4-3
  8110 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8190 mark orbits-letter-3
  8200 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8300 mark orbits-lane4-4
  8310 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8390 mark orbits-letter-4
  8400 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8500 mark orbits-lane4-5
  8510 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8590 mark orbits-letter-5
  8600 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8700 mark orbits-lane4-6
  8710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8790 mark orbits-letter-6
  8800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8900 mark orbits-complete
  9100 mark jupiter-lock-1
  9110 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
  9500 mark replacement-ball-1
  9510 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  9800 mark jupiter-lock-2-multiball
  9810 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
 10200 mark replacement-ball-2
 10210 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
 10500 mark multiball-running
 10510 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
 10800 mark jackpot-1
 10810 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 11200 mark superjackpot-1
 11210 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 11600 mark jackpot-2
 11610 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 12000 mark superjackpot-2
 12010 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 12400 mark end
